format: rtsmap/1
id: light-of-night
name: "The Light of Night"
author: "tankcmdr6 (Red Alert 2, 2001); converted"
description: "A town at night for eight: two elevated highways on concrete spans run across it over the streets, lit roads and brick pavements between the blocks, a seaport on the bay, gold by every base and many oil derricks to take. From The Light Of Night II (#2lightonight.mpr)."
origin: ra2
size: [256, 256]
playable: { left: -131, top: 142, right: 133, bottom: 363 }
climate: urban
lighting: night
players: 8
starts:
  - { slot: 1, cell: [135, 201] }
  - { slot: 2, cell: [192, 162] }
  - { slot: 3, cell: [56, 170] }
  - { slot: 4, cell: [70, 106] }
  - { slot: 5, cell: [136, 141] }
  - { slot: 6, cell: [128, 78] }
  - { slot: 7, cell: [142, 42] }
  - { slot: 8, cell: [193, 119] }
legend:
  texture:
    a: asphalt
    b: shore
    e: street
    g: grass
    h: highway
    p: pavers
    u: track
    w: water
layers:
  height: |
